    /// semantic value (e.g. a slider thumb dragged along its track) and reports
    /// it here; the guest/app writes it into its bound state.
    ValueChanged {
        target: u32,
        value: f32,
    },
    /// A text field's value changed (host → guest). The new text is resolved
